{"t":"PPL","made":"2026-11-26 02:57","name":"PPL Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","employees":6546,"hq":"Allentown, PA, United States","website":"https://www.pplweb.com","summary_en":"PPL Corporation provides electricity and natural gas to approximately 3.6 million customers in the United States. It operates in three segments: Kentucky Regulated, Pennsylvania Regulated, and Rhode Island Regulated. The company engages in the transmission and distribution of electricity in eastern and central Pennsylvania; generation, transmission, distribution, and sale of electricity in Kentucky, Virginia, and Rhode Island; distribution and sale of natural gas in Kentucky and Rhode Island; sale of wholesale electricity in Kentucky; and generation of electricity from power plants in Kentucky. It generates electricity from coal, gas, hydro, and solar sources. The company was formerly known as PP&L Resources, Inc. and changed its name to PPL Corporation in 2000. PPL Corporation was founded in 1920 and is headquartered in Allentown, Pennsylvania.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"PPL Corporation은 미국 내 약 360만 고객에게 전기와 천연가스를 공급합니다. 켄터키 규제, 펜실베니아 규제, 로드아일랜드 규제의 세 부분으로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 펜실베니아 동부 및 중부 지역에서 전력 송전 및 배전을 담당하고 있습니다. 켄터키, 버지니아, 로드 아일랜드의 전력 생산, 송전, 배전 및 판매; 켄터키와 로드아일랜드의 천연가스 유통 및 판매; 켄터키의 도매 전기 판매; 켄터키주 발전소에서 전력 생산. 석탄, 가스, 수력, 태양광 발전을 통해 전기를 생산합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 PP&L Resources, Inc.로 알려져 있었으며 2000년에 PPL Corporation으로 이름을 변경했습니다. PPL Corporation은 1920년에 설립되었으며 펜실베이니아주 Allentown에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":35.475,"mcap":26703728640.0,"pe":20.38793,"fpe":16.751741,"peg":1.2692,"ps":2.765506,"pb":1.7553191,"ev_ebitda":12.142,"div":3.24,"beta":0.56,"hi52":40.11,"lo52":31.56},"fin":{"rev":9656000512.0,"rev_g":0.115,"eps_g":0.131,"gross":0.44221002,"op":0.24234,"net":0.13618,"roe":0.08879,"fcf":-1881374976.0,"cash":393000000.0,"debt":20941000704.0,"de":137.688,"eps":1.74,"feps":2.11769},"own":{"short":0.0542,"inst":0.91920996,"insider":